WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.049
Every decision here has one owner,

2
00:00:02.049 --> 00:00:04.975
and that's what keeps the
migration from stalling.

3
00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:07.861
Identity engineering owns the plumbing,

4
00:00:07.861 --> 00:00:11.087
the delegation model and
each wave's go or no-go.

5
00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:15.413
The ICAM governance body owns the
authority map and the person key.

6
00:00:15.413 --> 00:00:18.681
HR owns the codes, the
data architect the schema,

7
00:00:18.681 --> 00:00:21.949
and application owners
their own access rules.

8
00:00:21.949 --> 00:00:25.350
The CISO owns the controls
and the drift findings.

9
00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:30.817
And you can start Monday without new tools:
export the tree, name the HR feed early,

10
00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:35.538
populate the person key, remove other
writers, and route your logs out.

11
00:00:35.538 --> 00:00:38.476
Make the attributes
true, and keep them true.

12
00:00:38.476 --> 00:00:39.290
Thank you.
